    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "# How To: Prompt AI Tutor\n\nLet's learn how to use AI to create our web page. Read through the following steps, then try it out yourself!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/41a84d3ffd2a38785562ac41aec9b410-ai-curriculum-societal-impacts.png",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-lesson3-level1_2026-2818636e-1365-4c59-bb17-9b2e6b832ac9",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "# Prompt AI Tutor\n\nTell AI Tutor what you want it to do by typing your message into the chat box. \n\nWhen you're ready, click the purple **Send** arrow or hit **Enter** on your keyboard.\n\n_Note: You may want to minimize the instructions to see your full prompt._",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/79c5e362d5efa2b265aeae9207a7c6ec-prompt.gif",
        "key": "undefined-205a9cb6-4e78-4814-929e-fec9c89b847c",
        "layout": "text-top-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "#Preview the Output\n\nClick **Preview** to see what AI created. ",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/eafff3e027b8c7709c8531fdb2419c28-preview.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-lesson3-level1_2026-9b8c74a7-b72a-4930-8b41-4cade9e230fe",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "# Accept / Reject AI Code\n\nIf the code matches what you want, click **Accept**. \n\nWrite a brief message like \"Generated index.html for gardening app\". Then click **Accept and save version**.\n\nIf the code is not quite right, click **Reject** and try re-prompting AI.\n\n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/75cd37fd67d920e6978bebc48fa1e5e4-accept-changes.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-lesson3-level1_2026-96e6e9af-0122-48a5-a798-ceafe83766a9",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      }
    ],
    "name_suffix": "_2026"
  },
